flowchart TD
    Failure[PipelineFailure fixture]
    Store[In-memory failure list]
    TFIDF[TF-IDF vectors]
    Similarity[Cosine similarity search]
    Rules[Keyword classifier]
    Pattern[Repeated-category check]
    Suggestions[Rule-based suggestions]
    Result[Analysis dictionary]

    Failure --> Store
    Store --> TFIDF
    Failure --> TFIDF
    TFIDF --> Similarity
    Failure --> Rules
    Similarity --> Pattern
    Rules --> Pattern
    Pattern --> Suggestions
    Suggestions --> Result

    Tests[Repository-authored synthetic tests]
    Tests -.-> Rules
    Tests -.-> Pattern
    Tests -.-> Suggestions

    note1[No database, persistent vector store, or automated remediation]
    note1 -.-> Store
